descriptions.job-0d5x628:
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;JAF7dFJcWoUusRx7RKkuM14BsYc&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusd6NtLTrM8e4ysmP03OKuHd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZDGzdXG4poqMiSxarJbuzJzls1d&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe the future will be reshaped by technology. Founded in 2017, we are revolutionising world systems through our cutting-edge digital asset exchange, Web3 portal and blockchain ecosystems. We reshape the financial ecosystem by offering some of the most diverse and sophisticated products, solutions, and trading tools on the market. Trusted by more than 50 million users in over 180 countries globally, OKX empowers every individual to explore the world of Web3. With our extensive range of products and services, and unwavering commitment to innovation, OKX envisions a world of financial access backed by blockchain and the power of decentralized finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gl1LdkPshoiSWZxHa1gu5TZpswd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SIXmdStKwor48cxQEKYuF78zs8b&quot;&gt;We are innovative in the way we think, work, and in the products we create. We are also socially responsible by actively participating and encouraging employees to take part in various public welfare activities. With more than 3,000 employees around the world, we believe embracing diversity and inclusion will spark the creation of long-term value for the industry. Come Build the Future with Us now!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus6W44CsvjWg7Am35twN6Dpe&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusl417D129Ked7hp9WBVv9lg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuss6XESKYQHip9PQStty5I5K&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;ZyqTdrSFmoaarAxb9b7lczejgSe&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgJrFb6UcbpCYA7L7RjXrgLh&quot;&gt;We’re continuously meeting product design talent interested in shaping the future of centralized exchange products at OKX.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgkCatbBzSkUE41nvA3hWcMh&quot;&gt;Our CEX Product Design team works across &lt;strong&gt;Manual Trading, Trading Strategy, Social &amp;amp; VIP, Growth, and Institutional&lt;/strong&gt; products. Depending on your experience, interests, and our current hiring needs, we’ll explore relevant opportunities across different teams and levels.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgr83W11EEAFJC4PkDVpJKuf&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;ZyqTdrSFmoaarAxb9b7lczejgSe&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgoJD4dE0wm0fVY84PUDBUtb&quot;&gt;We design products for complex, fast-moving financial environments. Our work spans high-frequency and high-consideration user journeys, data-dense interfaces, trading and investment decisions, social experiences, and products serving both individual and institutional customers.&amp;nbsp;Designers partner closely with Product, Engineering, Research, Content Design, Data, and other functions from early exploration through delivery and iteration. We care about interaction quality and visual craft, but also expect designers to understand the product deeply, navigate constraints, and influence the decisions that shape the customer experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgLUqseP2hVpvuZ1ERokIXzd&quot;&gt;Depending on team needs and your interests, your work may focus on:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg5E1PnZL7PV2Lw7Os8sCB8b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manual Trading&lt;/strong&gt; — helping customers discover markets, analyze information, place and manage trades, and understand their positions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgkDBmvv08w26w2ysF8qqFsp&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trading Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; — designing tools and workflows that help customers create, discover, evaluate, and manage trading strategies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgx5SYMWzA6nK2nI77TDXnJl&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social &amp;amp; VIP&lt;/strong&gt; — building differentiated experiences for social trading, communities, creators, and high-value customers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgCS10mC9mVVkxOTUcbsn4Ne&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt; — improving acquisition, activation, engagement, retention, and cross-product discovery across the customer journey.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgWGyNVIeeLngmbohsX0WG1g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Institutional&lt;/strong&gt; — designing sophisticated, efficient, and trustworthy products for professional and institutional customers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
