&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgzWhLdoJqcQYmK6zGmIlzPI&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design clear, intuitive, and trustworthy experiences for complex and data-intensive products.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgCzOWTueBzMLQUDifQybWrg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Turn customer insights, product strategy, business goals, and technical constraints into coherent user journeys and detailed interactions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg33RVcCkJyWAy7GYm6ehxLg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Work across the end-to-end design process, from problem framing and early exploration to prototyping, delivery, validation, and iteration.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgLdJhDUkUnb0rBrKhVS0FSf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
