&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgHmqXAja1zbMhmVs03tsdtf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Use qualitative research, product analytics, experimentation, and market understanding to inform and evaluate design decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgwXPJsatruCniXZRUlp1Qpg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Present your work clearly, explain the reasoning behind your decisions, and use feedback to improve the outcome.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgE1bs2C2z6lDTBRzEyEDEYc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
